# Agent-generated retro snippets, kept out of version control BY DEFAULT --
# not because they are unsafe to publish, but because changing an existing
# project's history on upgrade would be worse than an over-cautious default.
#
# This file only governs THIS directory. The destination is `RETRO_DIR` in
# af-env.conf; point it at a tracked directory (e.g. docs/retros) and retros
# become reviewable project history, and this rule stops applying to them.
#
# The workflow logs are a different case: they embed the user request verbatim,
# and they stay local unconditionally.
#
# Hand-written retrospectives live one level up and stay the project's choice.
*
!.gitignore
